			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1128,
				10
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Introduce AirClient DTOs and streaming wrapper\n\nCreate the `AirClient` module within Mountain to define Data Transfer Objects for communicating with the Air sidecar daemon. This includes structures for metrics (`AirMetrics`), status (`AirStatus`), file operations (`FileInfo`, `ExtendedFileInfo`, `FileResult`), resource monitoring (`ResourceUsage`), and update metadata (`UpdateInfo`).\n\nAdditionally, implement `DownloadStream` and `DownloadStreamChunk` to wrap the Tonic streaming API. This adapter converts the raw gRPC stream into an idiomatic `next().await` iterator, handling error propagation and metadata extraction for binary payload downloads.\n\nAll structs utilize the project's `Struct` naming convention and include `#[allow(non_snake_case)]` where appropriate to align with legacy gRPC protobuf naming. These additions provide the necessary client-side representation for the Air daemon's file transfer and monitoring capabilities via the Vine protocol.",
			"SHA": "5cf0e601ab8ac6be24f713b469a207ef5c98655d"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-02T06:36:04Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1117,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Invoke Vine gRPC ConnectToSideCar via explicit Fn method\n\nUpdate the Air sidecar launch logic in `AirStart.rs` to explicitly call the `::Fn` associated method for `ConnectToSideCar` on the `Vine::Client` gRPC stub. This change aligns with the updated calling convention for the Vine protocol client established in recent refactors, ensuring proper method resolution and preventing potential compilation errors or runtime mismatches when establishing the gRPC connection to the Air daemon.\n\nThis ensures consistent RPC communication with the Air sidecar across the Mountain backend.",
			"SHA": "1ec8fe99d021b78ad6a2d1b4d4316d4581878394"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
